===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|meninge}}

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|NL.|mēninx}}, from {{bor|en|grc|μῆνῐγξ||membrane of the eye; membrane enclosing the brain; eardrum}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ˈmiː.nɪŋks/}}
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|en|/ˈmiː.nɪŋks/|/ˈmɛn.ɪŋks/}}
* {{rhymes|en|iːnɪŋks|ɛnɪŋks}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|meninges}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy|usually plural}} A [[membrane]], especially one of the three membranes lining the [[skull]] and [[vertebral canal]] and [[enclose|enclosing]] the [[brain]] and [[spinal cord]] in [[vertebrates]].
#: {{syn|en|mater}}
#: {{meronyms|en|arachnoid mater|dura mater|pia mater}}

